        "title": "除非 / 否则: 除非…否则/不然 states what follows without an exception",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "除非 states the exceptional condition needed to avoid the 否则/不然 outcome. The exception is necessary, not automatically sufficient for success.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "除非你帮助我，否则我完成不了。",
                "pinyin": "chúfēi nǐ bāngzhù wǒ ， fǒuzé wǒ wánchéng bù liǎo 。",
                "meaning": "Unless you help me, I cannot finish.",
                "audio": "3ed972d3b3e1472a609c29e10f1bc435eb5a92674650d6b848f21cea92f76dd9"
              },
              {
                "text": "除非雨停，不然我们不走。",
                "pinyin": "chúfēi yǔ tíng ， bùrán wǒmen bù zǒu 。",
                "meaning": "Unless the rain stops, we will not leave.",
                "audio": "9b6bffbd6183fb8088f263ff74a54324ed480e2e9500132172ba42f8a6594a7c"
              }
            ]
          },
